Awesome — here are the full, updated MVP files for a Firefox add-on that shows a persistent bottom-right overlay “Export” button on both chatgpt.com and chat.openai.com. Clicking it just echoes (alert + console log) for now.

File tree
cppchatgpt-export-overlay-mvp/
├─ manifest.json
└─ content.js


manifest.json
json{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "ChatGPT Export — Overlay MVP",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Shows a persistent bottom-right Export button on ChatGPT pages (echoes on click).",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://chat.openai.com/*",
        "https://chatgpt.com/*"
      ],
      "js": ["content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
