Awesome — here’s the full v0.3 update with a sanitizer + block chunker, upgraded schema, and the same persistent bottom-right button. On click, it harvests the whole conversation into a modular structure, stores it at window.__CGPT_EXPORT.lastHarvest, logs it, and copies the JSON to your clipboard.

File tree
cppchatgpt-export-overlay-mvp/
├─ manifest.json
└─ content.js


manifest.json
json{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "ChatGPT Export — Overlay (v0.3)",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "Bottom-right Export button that harvests the whole conversation into modular blocks for UI selection.",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://chat.openai.com/*",
        "https://chatgpt.com/*"
      ],
      "js": ["content.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ]
